IMAPAccount cultivate
Host imap.gmail.com
User talati@getcultivate.ai
AuthMechs XOAuth2
PassCmd "python /usr/share/neomutt/oauth2/mutt_oauth2.py --encryption-pipe 'cat' --decryption-pipe 'cat' ~/decrypt/secrets/oauth/cultivate.oauth2"
TLSType IMAPS

IMAPStore cultivate-remote
Account cultivate

MaildirStore cultivate-local
Path ~/mail/cultivate/
Inbox ~/mail/cultivate/Inbox
Subfolders Verbatim

Channel cultivate
Far :cultivate-remote:
Near :cultivate-local:
Patterns *
Create Both
SyncState *
Expunge Both
